  "description": "Hawas Tropical by Rasasi is a vibrant, refreshing take on the Hawas line—built for warm weather, beach days, and resort-style freshness. It opens with a juicy splash of pineapple, mango, and bright citrus, creating an immediate tropical-fruit burst. The heart adds aromatic touches of lavender and cardamom with breezy oceanic notes, giving the scent a clean, airy feel. The base settles into soft woods, musk, and a creamy tropical amber, offering a smooth, long-lasting finish that stays fresh while adding warmth and depth. An ideal choice for customers who want a playful but mature tropical scent that feels both exotic and clean.",
